From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 18:14:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/35] node-executor: restore public stream processing API

Restore the public stream-processing exports and preserve the response-part type expected by downstream consumers. Keep the API compatibility changes together so operators can adopt or omit the complete surface as one patch.
---
